	// MECHANISM-2: The cubic term creates sharp differentiation at high load ratios. A slightly lower coefficient (0.09 vs 0.1) may prevent over-penalizing instances during transient spikes, reducing P95 tail latency while maintaining load balancing.
	// EXPECT-2: avg_p95_ms < 5175
